# The web image's context, in place of the root `.dockerignore`. Everything is
# out unless it is named: the workspace, the design language the stylesheet
# imports, and this image's Caddyfile.

*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!rust-toolchain.toml
!crates/
!sketches/shared/
!deploy/web/Caddyfile

# What trunk and cargo write on a laptop. `dist` alone is tens of megabytes of
# a debug build.
crates/web-main/dist/
**/target/
**/logs/
**/*.log
